        {
          "id": "bd3f0e6f-0463-3b86-bd6a-f9d339ed1b68",
          "content": {
            "id": "bd3f0e6f-0463-3b86-bd6a-f9d339ed1b68",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Solana blockchain is set to scale, ethereum isn't: Solmate CEO",
            "description": "<p>Digital asset treasury company Solmate \u2014 rebranded from Brera Holdings (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BREA\">BREA</a>) \u2014 will be shifting its focus to operating on a Solana-based (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SOL-USD\">SOL-USD</a>) blockchain rather than ethereum (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ETH-USD\">ETH-USD</a>).</p>\n<p>Solmate founder and CEO Marco Santori, who was recently appointed chief executive, explains why Solana could be a better crypto platform. Also catch Santori's comment on <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/gold-rush-mentality-feeding-digital-203024585.html\">the \"gold rush\" mentality</a> driving digital asset treasury expansions.</p>\n<p>Santori previously served as an advisor to the International Monetary Fund (IMF) and chairman of the Bitcoin Foundation Regulatory Affairs Committee.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Digital asset treasury company Solmate \u2014 rebranded from Brera Holdings (BREA) \u2014 will be shifting its focus to operating on a Solana-based (SOL-USD) blockchain rather than ethereum (ETH-USD). Solmate founder and CEO Marco Santori, who was recently appointed chief executive, explains why Solana could be a better crypto platform. Also catch Santori's comment on the \"gold rush\" mentality driving digital asset treasury expansions. Santori previously served as an advisor to the International Monetary Fund (IMF) and chairman of the Bitcoin Foundation Regulatory Affairs Committee. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
