        {
          "id": "1ae86ea9-7815-3cf0-8015-1a63b5d63c06",
          "content": {
            "id": "1ae86ea9-7815-3cf0-8015-1a63b5d63c06",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "'Gold rush' mentality is feeding digital asset treasury growth",
            "description": "<p>There's been a boom in digital asset treasuries (DAT) while other public companies added cryptocurrencies to their balance sheets. One such company is Brera Holdings (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BREA\">BREA</a>), which is rebranding to Solmate and has received <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/cathie-wood-backed-sports-stock-162001247.html\">backing from Cathie Wood</a>, whose ARK Invest (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ARKK\">ARKK</a>) acquired $49.72 million worth of shares in September.</p>\n<p>Solmate founder and CEO Marco Santori \u2014 who was recently appointed chief executive \u2014 talks more about the company's focus on the Solana (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SOL-USD\">SOL-USD</a>) ecosystem and the growth of digital asset treasury companies.</p>\n<p>Santori previously served as an advisor to the International Monetary Fund (IMF) and chairman of the Bitcoin Foundation Regulatory Affairs Committee.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "There's been a boom in digital asset treasuries (DAT) while other public companies added cryptocurrencies to their balance sheets. One such company is Brera Holdings (BREA), which is rebranding to Solmate and has received backing from Cathie Wood, whose ARK Invest (ARKK) acquired $49.72 million worth of shares in September. Solmate founder and CEO Marco Santori \u2014 who was recently appointed chief executive \u2014 talks more about the company's focus on the Solana (SOL-USD) ecosystem and the growth of digital asset treasury companies. Santori previously served as an advisor to the International Monetary Fund (IMF) and chairman of the Bitcoin Foundation Regulatory Affairs Committee. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
